    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the general city law, in relation to prohibiting the destruction of information submitted by applicants for municipal forms of identification, and requiring such information to be submitted to the division of homeland security and emergency services and the office for new Americans",
    "basePrintNo": "S3848",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S3848-2017",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
      {
       "alternate": false,
